{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0043_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ad3aa81a66642a5cd9ec27a606942dc2b495a960551ce55554ef8a4c05869ba3", "ja": "おはよう、海美。\nあれ、今日は休みじゃなかったのか？", "zh": "早安，海美。\n怪了？你今天不是休假吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0043_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "9b356c7116b440dd50a5562303764fec83382d040ee6aae55fffdf8d0bca9c71", "ja": "うん、そうなんだけどね！\n早く目が覚めたから、つい来ちゃった☆", "zh": "嗯，是没错啦！\n因为我很早就醒了，忍不住就跑来啰☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0043_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "92c6e27051c11b8913d58fae5b640c305af5ab010e8f713992f855e22c8e9d6f", "ja": "ランニング、楽しいよー！\n{$P$}も、一緒に走る？", "zh": "慢跑很有趣喔～！\n{$P$}要不要也一起跑？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0043_1005_p", "source_sha256": "56e71bf86e5d13093466f0d9b82dea5f859441890ae20300bf04a72ab72225ef", "ja": "いや、今から仕事だから……というか走ってきたのか？\n昨日ライブだったのに、元気だな。", "zh": "不，我要开始工作了……话说你是跑来的吗？\n明明昨天才开完演唱会，你真有活力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0043_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "5ea68c435a27f4486cd445e20a388c9e078f29ac7958ad2159b02dc4faaf34e6", "ja": "えへへ、まあね～。\n元気なのが、私の取り柄だしっ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，是啊～\n因为有活力是我的优点嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0043_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5e5eed942ac19821c9bcf46485f2346fe30949b20bb348fddb7ad59eb8413acf", "ja": "確かにそうだな。昨日のライブでも、\nお客さんは海美から元気をもらっていたと思うよ。", "zh": "的确如此。昨天的演唱会上，\n我想观众们也从海美身上分到不少活力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0043_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "4c18383f3c9531c8806c18aff8a924c5b3268718a5e5d6a22613f2402c422cd9", "ja": "えっ？　そ、そうかな？\nそうだといいな～……えへへ……♪", "zh": "咦……是、是吗？\n希望是这样～嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0043_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "9e6189517bd93bfa3513e88a40413adc7612b4658ee97d9d00bf90f752e127c9", "ja": "{$P$}！\n私、もっと元気になるっ。見ててねっ！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n我会变得更有活力的，你要看好喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0043_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "2879a5d426d2b72796d6510b4576696e5bd0303cc7608c99c971ce4eb1f224b2", "ja": "じゃあ、行ってきまーす！", "zh": "那我走啰──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0043_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d5738cc798bcd33c2061b6fc7f674936b195e99462b5ccc6c826a9e318822849", "ja": "え？　お、おい、海美！？\nどこに行くんだ海美！", "zh": "咦？呃，喂，海美！？\n你要上哪去啊，海美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0043_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "a26c09c58c505b0fafda15ed34ec8ff9e4b4169b2f4b9a8f0d95f721816ee39f", "ja": "うん！　ちょっとこの辺り、10周してくる！\nじゃあねーっ！", "zh": "嗯！我去附近跑个10圈！\n拜啰──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0043_1013_p", "source_sha256": "0755fc4a18e6c05ee4bb9dd600748642a62e9b70356337a07bc94d4b9d0ca6a6", "ja": "いや、その元気は誰にも届かないような……\n行ってしまったか。車に気を付けるんだぞ！", "zh": "等等，你现在冲出去大概也没办法把活力分给任何人……\n走掉了啊。要小心车子喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
